----- stdout -----
Interact with AWS Deadline Cloud to submit, monitor, and manage render jobs.

Learn more about Deadline Cloud (https://docs.aws.amazon.com/deadline-cloud/latest/userguide/what-is-deadline-cloud.html)

Usage: deadline [OPTIONS] [COMMAND]

Commands:
  config      View and update workstation configuration
  auth        Manage authentication for Deadline Cloud
  farm        List or get Deadline Cloud farms
  fleet       List or get Deadline Cloud fleets
  queue       List or get Deadline Cloud queues
  job         List or get Deadline Cloud jobs
  worker      List or get Deadline Cloud workers
  attachment  BETA - Upload or download job attachment data files
  manifest    BETA - Create, compare, download, and upload job attachment manifests
  help        Print this message or the help of the given subcommand(s)

Options:
      --log-level <LOG_LEVEL>
          Set the logging level
      --redirect-output <REDIRECT_OUTPUT>
          Redirect stdout and stderr to the specified file
      --redirect-mode <REDIRECT_MODE>
          When using --redirect-output, append (default) or replace the file [default: append] [possible values: append, replace]
  -h, --help
          Print help
  -V, --version
          Print version

